<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - New Holland, Transkaryotic started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - New Holland, Transkaryotic started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of New Holland NV and Transkaryotic Therapies Inc, both with strong buy ratings on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Transkaryotic shares rose 1/2 to 18-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Transkaryotic went public in October at $15 a share. Morgan Stanley was the lead underwriter of the offering.</p>
<p>-- New Holland shares rose 3/8 to 20-1/8. New Holland, a manufacturer of agricultural and heavy machinery, went public in early November at $21.50 a share.</p>
</text>
